app.created	An app was created.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go CreateApp
app.deleted	An app was deleted (teardown per ADR-0023).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeleteApp
app.teardown_aborted	An app delete was aborted after teardown because a deployment was admitted mid-delete; the in-flight deployment rebuilds the carriers (ADR-0023).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeleteApp (recordTeardownAbort)
build.building	Build started executing.	added during implementation
build.cancelled	Build cancelled.	added during implementation
build.expired	Build expired by timeout watchdog.	added during implementation
build.failed	Build failed.	added during implementation
build.queued	Build accepted into build queue.	added during implementation
build.succeeded	Build produced an image digest.	added during implementation
config.updated	A config version was written.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go PutConfig
database.created	A database was created from a template; the platform minted its credential secret (value never returned).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/databases.go CreateDatabase
database.deleted	A database was deleted (carriers torn down, row tombstoned; volume and credential secret retained as project materials).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/databases.go DeleteDatabase
deployment.building	Deployment entered build stage.	added during implementation
deployment.cancelled	Deployment cancelled while queued or in flight.	added during implementation
deployment.failed	Deployment reached failed terminal state.	added during implementation
deployment.first_boot_job	A deploy-time first boot job was minted as a one-shot task; the deployment waits in releasing for its terminal state before materializing carriers (ADR-0030).	internal/engine/firstboot.go mintFirstBootJob
deployment.observing	Deployment entered health observation window.	added during implementation
deployment.preparing	Deployment started preparing spec and materials.	added during implementation
deployment.queued	Deployment accepted by admission queue.	added during implementation
deployment.releasing	Deployment started releasing workloads to runtime.	added during implementation
deployment.rolling_back	Deployment started replaying last successful revision.	added during implementation
deployment.succeeded	Deployment reached succeeded terminal state.	added during implementation
deployment.superseded	Deployment superseded by a newer one.	added during implementation
freeze.lifted	A change freeze was lifted; change verbs in scope are accepted again.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/governance.go LiftChangeFreeze
freeze.set	A change freeze was set for a team (or globally); change verbs in scope are refused with the reason.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/governance.go SetChangeFreeze
hook.push_accepted	A verified webhook push triggered a deployment.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/webhook.go handlePush
invitation.accepted	An invitation was redeemed; the invitee became a user.	added during implementation
invitation.created	An invitation was issued (single-use, time-boxed, role-bound).	added during implementation
lease.expired	A task's owner lease expired past grace; the pool drains.	internal/engine/task.go driveTask
lease.renewed	A task's owner lease was renewed (deadline advanced).	internal/engine/task.go RenewTask
network.created	A project network was created.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go CreateNetwork
network.peer_approved	The receiving project approved a peer attachment; references become projectable.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go ApproveNetworkPeer
network.peer_declared	A peer project declared intent to attach to a network (pending; needs receiver approval).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeclareNetworkPeer
network.peer_revoked	A peer attachment was revoked; existing attachments are isolated by an immediate isolate reconverge (ADR-0013 appendix A.4).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go RevokeNetworkPeer
node.joined	Node joined the cluster and was anchored with a platform node ID.	added during implementation
node.left	Node left the cluster.	added during implementation
project.created	A project was created.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go CreateProject
project.deleted	A project was deleted (tombstoned).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeleteProject
role.created	A custom role was created from a scope set.	added during implementation
run.created	A run was created and queued for carrier ensure.	internal/engine/task.go createRun
run.failed	A run reached the failed terminal state.	internal/engine/taskobs.go handleRunObservation
run.running	A run's workload was observed running.	internal/engine/taskobs.go handleRunObservation
run.stopped	A run reached the stopped terminal state.	internal/engine/taskobs.go handleRunObservation
run.stopping	A run started stopping (stop reason carried on the row).	internal/engine/task.go stopRunRow
schedule.created	A schedule was created (timezone-aware cron, first fire time computed).	internal/engine/events.go EventScheduleCreated (emitted by the acceptance surface)
schedule.deleted	A schedule was deleted (tombstoned; already-spawned tasks run to completion).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/automation.go DeleteSchedule
schedule.fired	A schedule fired and spawned a one-shot task (source: cron or manual).	internal/engine/schedule.go spawnScheduleTask
schedule.skipped	A due schedule fire was skipped (reason: overlap while the previous run is in flight, or quota_exceeded when the project is at its task quota).	internal/engine/schedule.go fireSchedule/skipSchedule
secret.deleted	A secret was deleted.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go DeleteSecret
secret.updated	A secret value was set (fingerprint, never the value).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go PutSecret
task.active	A drained task was revived by an owner lease renewal.	internal/engine/task.go RenewTask
task.completed	A one-shot task's run completed successfully.	internal/engine/task.go oneshotTerminal
task.created	A task was created (one-shot or resident form).	internal/engine/events.go EventTaskCreated (emitted by the acceptance surface)
task.deleted	A task was deleted (carriers removed, row tombstoned).	internal/engine/task.go DeleteTask
task.drained	A draining task reached drained state (all runs terminal).	internal/engine/task.go driveTask
task.draining	A task started draining: replenishment stopped; in-flight runs stop with grace or run out their TTL.	internal/engine/task.go drainTask
task.failed	A one-shot task's run failed.	internal/engine/task.go oneshotTerminal
task.updated	A task's desired concurrency was updated.	internal/engine/task.go ScaleTask
team.created	A team was created.	added during implementation
token.created	A token was minted (secret shown once at creation).	added during implementation
token.revoked	A token was revoked; its next call will be rejected.	added during implementation
upload.stored	An uploaded source was stored (content-addressed; payload carries id, digest, size and deduplicated).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/uploads.go UploadSource
user.created	A user was created and granted a role in a team.	added during implementation
volume.created	A volume was created.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go CreateVolume
workload.drift_detected	Observed workload diverged from the ensured generation or spec (ADR-0022).	internal/engine/observ.go detectDrift + internal/engine/drift.go compareSpecs
workload.stopped	A steady-state workload was observed stopped at the current generation.	internal/engine/drift.go emitSteadyStateStopped
